silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_08_sections_02_concrete_anchor_1#forbiddendeletionbatch silm:hasLongDescription "The ForbiddenDeletionBatch is a candidate deletion batch; rejected by naturality. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'E^del_n', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
